SUMMARY:Jack Dee: Jack’s Joke Show
LOCATION:Black Box Theatre\, Galway
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating 40 years in stand-up\, Jack Dee returns to Galway t
 his October to take us on a memoir of his favourite old jokes and funny ane
 cdotes that have intrigued him for as long as he can remember. We can look 
 forward to a master comic who “turns grumpiness into an art form” (The 
 Evening Standard) and whose “put-upon\, misanthropic persona” always re
 sults in “an entertaining evening” (The Scotsman). He has appeared on H
 ave I Got News for You\, QI\, The Apprentice: You’re Fired\, The Apprenti
 ce: You’re Hired\, and comedy series Josh. Age 16+ | Unreserved seating |
  These tickets are non-refundable except in the event of a cancellation or 
